            "review_title": "Review at Leresto",
            "review_text": "DirtyPierreOnTour\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12577 contributions\n10\nLe Resto has moved to a much better location.\nJan 2020 • Couples\n30 Cao Thang location closed on the 11th October and reopened at their new address 357 Hoang Sa, Phuong Tan Dinh, District 1,\nHo Chi Minh City.\nTonight I enjoyed for an Appetizer Farcie Avocado which consists of half an Avocado with Tuna Mayonnaise and a large prawn on top.\nThen a hard boiled egg yolk was grated over the top.\nTheir new location boasts magnificent views from their open air upper floors.\nFor me it's a much nicer location with a lot more parking space than their old address had. I have attended many dinners there and wasn't till tonight I realised TripAdvisor didn't have the new location.\nBeing the Destination Expert for HCMC it would be remiss of me not to correct this mistake.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
