            "review_title": "Review at Leresto",
            "review_text": "NicoleATT\nSydney, Australia48 contributions\n0\nFrench cuisine at Vietnamese price\nDec 2018 • Family\nWe dinned at this restaurant each time we were on our holidays in Saigon since 2014. We give this restaurant an overall rating of excellent based its consistent qualities we experienced over the last four visits. We have tried various authentic French and Vietnames dishes and they are all delicious as we expected. There are a good selection of red wines from France. Service staffs are friendly, helpful and attentive. We, because of a large group, were given a private room on each occasion. There are several private rooms and each is temperature controlled and tastefully (Eastern-Western) decorated, which creates a warm and relax atmosphere.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 18, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
