            "review_text": "borus1\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam34 contributions\n0\nLe resto\nJan 2018\nThis restaurant is a must if you are looking for good value for money French cuisine restaurant. All kind of dishes : canard a l’orange , different steaks and pasta, salmon and a few other fish dishes as well as lamb . All are excellent. My favorite is Canard a l’orange The waiters always welcome you with a big smile. An absolute “ have to known “ in Saigon . Their slogan is French cuisine at Vietnamese price . That’s reality.\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2018",
